OL,3,GNEWSAHousehunter swaps Australia for   
OL,4,AWales' most affordable town - where    
OL,5,Alocals are struggling to buy           
OL,7,FA house-hunter has moved 10,000 miles  
OL,8,F(16,000km) from Australia to Wales'    
OL,9,Fmost affordable town because the       
OL,10,Fproperties are so cheap.               
OL,12,FJames Brown, 56, spotted the three-bed 
OL,13,Fhouse in Tylorstown, near Ferndale,    
OL,14,FRhondda Cynon Taf, online for #80,000  
OL,15,Fand put an offer in.                   
OL,17,F"It's ideal if you're commuting, and   
OL,18,Feverything's virtually on your         
OL,19,Fdoorstep, so a really affordable area  
OL,20,Fto come to," he said.                  
